# Helix SELECT-only warehouse

- All agent and explorer fetches go through dialect `select_rows` or `execute_select`.
- Keep `validate_select` and `FORBIDDEN_SQL` (INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE/MERGE/DDL/`EXEC`/`sp_`).
- Do not add stored-procedure execution or multi-statement write batches.
- Bound result rows (`max_rows` / TOP / FETCH / LIMIT). Honor `forbid_select_star` when set.

```python
# BAD: execute arbitrary SQL from the model
cursor.execute(user_sql)

# GOOD: validate then execute SELECT only
sql = validate_select(user_sql)
return execute_select(sql)
```
